Consequentials) Act 2"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6770c42f407c0e69e1aaa4e47519b16d87fed9cd386a96bc73c0d840fd131ec3" ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Application of old descent applications made under section 10B, 10C or 11 of the old Act to become an Australian citizen under section 16 of the new Act." ;
