concept:australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007-sch-3-sec-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 Review of decisions made under the old Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-10 ;
    values:originalText "Despite the repeal of the old Act made by item 42 of Schedule 1, section 52A of the old Act continues to apply in relation to a decision made under that Act, as if that repeal had not been made." ;
    skos:definition "Despite the repeal of the old Act made by item 42 of Schedule 1, section 52A of the old Act continues to apply in relation to a decision made under that Act, as if that repeal had not been made."@en ;
