concept:australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007-sch-3-sec-13 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "13 Transitional regulations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-13 ;
    values:originalText "The Governor-General may make regulations prescribing matters of a transitional nature (including prescribing any saving or application provisions) relating to:  (a) the amendments or repeals made by this Act; or  (b) the enactment of this Act or the new Act. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00383  Application and transitional provisions  Schedule 3 Provisions relating to the amendments made by Schedules 1 and 2 to this Act  Part 2  Australian Citizenship (Transitionals and Consequentials) Act 2007 Compilation date: 1/7/15 Registered: 10/8/15" ;
